  "text": "AlgaPSA\nHome\nUser Activities\nTickets\nProjects\nClients\nContacts\nInteractions\nDocuments\nAssets\nPasswords\nReports\nTime Management\nSchedule\nTechnician Dispatch\nWorkflows\nSystem Monitoring\nSettings\nSupport\nv1.6.12\nStar\nHome\nCo-managed access\nQuick Create\nBack to Email settings\nEmail and identity providers\n\nRegister your own Google or Microsoft application for inbound email, staff sign-in and directory setup. These credentials belong to your workspace.\n\nProvider setup\nGoogle or Microsoft setup\n\nMost companies set up one: Google or Microsoft. Set up both only if your company uses both.\n\nOpen Single Sign-On\nGoogle\nLoading\n\nStaff sign-in with Google, Gmail inbound email, and Google Calendar.\n\nMicrosoft\nLoading\n\nStaff sign-in with Microsoft, Outlook email, Outlook calendar sync, and Teams.\n\nGoogle\n\nEnter your company's Google OAuth app credentials for staff sign-in, Gmail inbound email, and Google Calendar.\n\nGoogle Cloud Console\nSetup guide\nLoading…",
